---
import {getImage} from 'astro:assets';
import icingSource from '../assets/wys/pink-icing-continuous.png';
import '../styles/wys-fonts.css';
const icing=await getImage({src:icingSource,format:'webp',quality:90});
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>TDIE — existing brand references</title></head><body><main>
<header><p class="label">Existing brand references</p><div class="wordmark">The Digital Income <span>Edit™</span></div><p class="source">Current website wordmark. Original logo asset has not been verified.</p></header>
<div class="photos"><figure><img src="/images/home/flagship-attic-900.webp" alt="Tommy Kate in her pink attic loft, with her glitter tumbler"/><figcaption>Pink attic loft · lived-in luxury · glitter catching the light</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/home/hero-pink-knit-desk-720.webp" alt="Tommy Kate working at her farmhouse window desk"/><figcaption>Farmhouse · pink knit · building a business in her own world</figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="look"><h1>Loud. Pink. Sparkly.<br/>Confident. Girly. Grown-up.</h1><blockquote>“A big pink glittery mashup of a self-made millionaire and a sparkly grown-up pop-star princess, in a homestead mom package.”</blockquote><p class="source">Your recorded brand direction · 4 October 2026</p></section>
<div class="specs"><section><p class="label">Color accents</p><div class="swatches"><span><i style="background:#D62E73"></i>Signature hot pink <small>#D62E73</small></span><span><i style="background:#FF8AC2"></i>Bubblegum pink <small>#FF8AC2</small></span><span><i style="background:#1A1417"></i>Near-black text <small>#1A1417</small></span></div><p>Pink in the lettering and details. No giant hot-pink background panels.</p></section><section><p class="label">Typography</p><h2 class="type-example">Newsreader SemiBold</h2><p>Upright headlines</p><p class="inter-example">Inter — clear, direct, readable.</p><p>Body, labels, navigation and buttons</p></section><section><p class="label">Finish and depth</p><div class="drip-detail" style={`background-image:url('${icing.src}')`}></div><p>Existing glitter-and-gloss drip artwork. Chrome, pearl and foil are material accents with depth—not floating circles or glitter wallpaper.</p></section><section><p class="label">Voice</p><h2>Founder with opinions.</h2><p>Loud and confident. Specific, curious, direct. Snarky, funny and smart on Threads; warm and peer-to-peer in the community.</p></section></div>
</main></body></html>
<style>html{background:#fff;color:#1a1417;font-family:Inter,sans-serif}body{margin:0}*{box-sizing:border-box}main{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:28px}header{text-align:center;padding-bottom:22px}.label{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#d62e73;margin:0 0 12px}.wordmark{font:600 38px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif}.wordmark span{color:#d62e73}.source{font:400 12px/1.5 Inter,sans-serif;margin:10px 0;color:#1a1417}.photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}figure{margin:0}figure img{width:100%;height:340px;display:block;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 42%}figcaption{font:400 12px/1.5 Inter,sans-serif;margin-top:9px}.look{padding:25px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:30px;align-items:center}.look h1{font:600 36px/1.08 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#d62e73;margin:0;grid-row:1/3}blockquote{margin:0;font:400 17px/1.5 Inter,sans-serif}.specs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px 35px}.specs section{border-top:1px solid #f0c1d5;padding-top:18px}.specs h2{font:600 26px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 6px}.specs p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;margin:5px 0}.specs p.label{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 12px}.swatches{display:flex;gap:18px}.swatches span{font-size:11px;flex:1}.swatches i{display:block;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;margin-bottom:7px}.swatches small{display:block;margin-top:4px}.drip-detail{height:58px;background-size:460px auto;background-repeat:repeat-x;background-position:top center;margin:0 0 8px}.inter-example{font-size:18px!important;margin-top:13px!important}@media(max-width:600px){main{padding:20px 16px}.wordmark{font-size:29px}.photos{gap:12px}figure img{height:215px}figcaption{font-size:11px}.look{display:block;padding:24px 0}.look h1{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:16px}blockquote{font-size:15px}.specs{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:23px}.specs h2{font-size:26px}.swatches{gap:12px}}
</style>
